title: They can measure its geometry|complexity.
pid: cf46ec92-1148-4d71-aef4-5f1710a1cc4f
body: |2-
  Structural signatures, not just behavioral ones: the workspace exists only in a middle band of layers (sensory → workspace → motor); it's capacity-limited (~25 vectors, <10% of variance, and it holds a whole category cheaply but only ~6 unrelated items, with a new category evicting the old); and ambiguous inputs resolve sharply and bimodally right at the workspace-onset layer — their analog of "ignition."
